sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Praxis as Praxis Proxy<br/>Identity Injection
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Provider<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant VectorDB as Vector Store<br/>Milvus/PgVector/Qdrant
    participant S3 as AWS S3<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Inference Request

    Client->>Praxis: POST /v1/responses<br/>Auth: OAuth2 Bearer Token
    Praxis->>OGX: Forward + x-user-id, x-tenant-id headers
    OGX->>OGX: Validate OAuth2 token (JWKS)
    OGX->>PostgreSQL: Store session state<br/>Auth: Password
    OGX->>vLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    vLLM-->>OGX: LLM Response
    OGX->>PostgreSQL: Update session
    OGX-->>Praxis: JSON Response
    Praxis-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: RAG (File Upload + Vector Search + Inference)

    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/files<br/>Auth: OAuth2 Token
    OGX->>OGX: Validate token + ownership
    alt S3 storage enabled
        OGX->>S3: Upload file<br/>Auth: IAM Credentials
        S3-->>OGX: Upload confirmation
    end
    OGX->>PostgreSQL: Store file metadata<br/>Auth: Password
    OGX-->>Client: File ID

    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/vector_stores<br/>Auth: OAuth2 Token
    OGX->>vLLM: Generate embeddings<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    vLLM-->>OGX: Embedding vectors
    OGX->>VectorDB: Store vectors<br/>Auth: Token/Password/API key
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Stored
    OGX-->>Client: Vector Store ID

    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/responses (with RAG)<br/>Auth: OAuth2 Token
    OGX->>VectorDB: Similarity search<br/>Auth: Token/Password/API key
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Relevant chunks
    OGX->>vLLM: Inference with context<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    vLLM-->>OGX: Generated response
    OGX->>PostgreSQL: Store conversation
    OGX-->>Client: Augmented response
